    "archive": "Include compact descriptive LastFM example; keep short-budget protocol separate. TCL parsed metrics contain duplicated first seed: use reconstructed 195-pair archive, not naive 10-entry average.",
    "positive_control": "Do not use as calibration of crossed link-prediction diagnostic. Published draft numbers reproduce best TEST across epochs, only 3 verified paired seeds; generator labels group membership, with within-group topology; source re-sorts after timestamp shuffle, so residual TGN score does not establish preserved original GRU order.",
    "shuffle_all": "Keep in audit only: node-property task, altered evaluation timestamps/label alignment, no crossed fixed-weight isolation. Current code disallows all-split shuffle for link prediction, so generic claim of changed negative sampler on tgbn-trade is incorrect.",
    "egrul": "Different private node-classification domain; null does not establish uninformative timestamps/reporting cadence mechanism. Not needed in short paper. H55 documents three seeds per resolution, native0.8092/shuffle0.8011; native-minus-shuffle is +0.0081, not -0.008. Separate P2_ref runs give0.818653/0.817373, so these sources must not be pooled. H55 language of decisive refutation is not supported by a null comparison.",
